Gauss Program File (continued)
n=rows(y);
k=cols(x);
a=n/(n-k);
sig2=(e’e)/(n-k);
u1=x.*e;
u2=x.*(e./(1-leverage));
u3=x.*(e./sqrt(1-leverage));
xx=inv(x’x);
v0=xx*sig2;
v1=xx*(u1’u1)*xx;
v1a=a*xx*(u1’u1)*xx;
v2=xx*(u2’u2)*xx;
v3=xx*(u3’u3)*xx
s0=sqrt(diag(v0));
@ Homoskedastic formula @
s1=sqrt(diag(v1));
@ White formula @
s1a=sqrt(diag(v1a));
@ Scaled White formula @
